{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00409","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 舒和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 舒和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祝史正辞，人神叶庆。\n福以德招，享以诚应。\n六变云备，百礼斯浃。\n祀事孔明，祚流万叶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}